{"seq":1,"slug":"crdts-for-apps","title":"应用层 CRDT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/data-consistency/crdts-for-apps","wordCount":1811,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用层-crdt\">应用层 CRDT</h1><p>冲突无可避免的前提下，有没有一类数据结构，能让任意顺序、任意次数地合并都收敛到同一结果，而不需要中心服务器仲裁？有——它叫 CRDT（Conflict-free Replicated Data Type，无冲突复制数据类型）。本节是本 hub 对 CRDT 类型与建模的权威讲解：从数学保证讲到具体类型，再讲如何用它们给真实应用建模。后续篇目遇到 CRDT 一律链回这里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CRDT 的全部魔力来自一条数学性质：合并操作必须是<strong>满足结合律、交换律、幂等律的半格（semilattice）合并</strong>。直观地说，无论以什么顺序、合并多少次，结果都一样。用公式表达，两个副本状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的合并 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊔</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqcup</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊔</span></span></span></span></span> 需满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊔</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⊔</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊔</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊔</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊔</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⊔</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>s</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_1 \\sqcup s_2 = s_2 \\sqcup s_1, \\quad (s_1 \\sqcup s_2) \\sqcup s_3 = s_1 \\sqcup (s_2 \\sqcup s_3), \\quad s \\sqcup s = s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要合并满足这三律，副本就无需协调地&quot;单调&quot;向同一个上确界收敛——这就是为什么 CRDT 能离线编辑、乱序同步还不打架。</p>\n<p>CRDT 分两大流派，下图说明它们的区别：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[CRDT 两大流派] --&gt; B[状态型 CvRDT]&#10;  A --&gt; C[操作型 CmRDT]&#10;  B --&gt; D[同步整个状态&lt;br/&gt;合并用 join]&#10;  D --&gt; E[传输大但容忍丢包/乱序]&#10;  C --&gt; F[同步每个操作&lt;br/&gt;需可靠有序投递]&#10;  F --&gt; G[传输小但依赖通道保证]&#10;  E --&gt; H[现代库多用 delta 状态型&lt;br/&gt;取两者之长]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[CRDT 两大流派] --&gt; B[状态型 CvRDT]\n  A --&gt; C[操作型 CmRDT]\n  B --&gt; D[同步整个状态&lt;br/&gt;合并用 join]\n  D --&gt; E[传输大但容忍丢包/乱序]\n  C --&gt; F[同步每个操作&lt;br/&gt;需可靠有序投递]\n  F --&gt; G[传输小但依赖通道保证]\n  E --&gt; H[现代库多用 delta 状态型&lt;br/&gt;取两者之长]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>应用层最常用的几种 CRDT 类型可以按数据形态归类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>CRDT</th>\n<th>合并语义</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标量</td>\n<td>LWW-Register</td>\n<td>时间戳大者胜</td>\n<td>单字段值（标题、状态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计数</td>\n<td>PN-Counter</td>\n<td>各副本增减求和</td>\n<td>点赞数、库存（弱一致）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合</td>\n<td>OR-Set</td>\n<td>加带唯一标签，删按标签</td>\n<td>标签、成员、多选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>映射</td>\n<td>LWW-Map / OR-Map</td>\n<td>逐键应用对应 CRDT</td>\n<td>对象、记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列</td>\n<td>RGA / Fugue</td>\n<td>元素带稳定身份与序</td>\n<td>列表、待办排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本</td>\n<td>序列 CRDT 变体</td>\n<td>字符级交织插入</td>\n<td>富文本协作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标量-计数-集合-从简到繁\">标量、计数、集合：从简到繁</h2><p><strong>LWW-Register</strong> 是最简单的 CRDT：每次写入带一个时间戳，合并时取时间戳大者。它的脆弱处全在&quot;时间戳&quot;上——纯物理时钟不可靠，所以实践中用混合逻辑时钟或带副本 ID 的逻辑时间戳来打破平局，细节见 <a href=\"causal-consistency-clocks\">因果一致性与时钟</a>。LWW 的代价是并发写同一字段时一方必然被丢弃，因此只适合&quot;丢一个无所谓&quot;的字段。</p>\n<p><strong>PN-Counter</strong> 解决 LWW 的丢数据问题。它给每个副本维护两个只增的计数器（正增量 P、负增量 N），值是所有副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum P_i - \\sum N_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。两人各点一次赞，合并后是二而非一——求和而非覆盖。但要注意 PN-Counter 不能表达&quot;库存不能为负&quot;这类约束，强一致的扣减仍需服务端权威。</p>\n<p><strong>OR-Set</strong>（Observed-Remove Set）是集合 CRDT 的主力。它的关键设计是：每次&quot;加&quot;都附一个全局唯一标签，&quot;删&quot;则记录被删元素的具体标签集合。这样&quot;加 X&quot;和&quot;删 X&quot;并发时，加用的是新标签、删针对的是旧标签，结果是 X 仍在集合中——体现了 OR-Set 的&quot;加优先&quot;语义。这个看似多余的标签机制，正是为了让并发的加删能确定性收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"序列与文本-最难的-crdt\">序列与文本：最难的 CRDT</h2><p>列表排序和文本编辑是 CRDT 里最难的部分，因为<strong>位置会漂移</strong>。如果用整数下标表示位置，对方在你前面插入一个元素，你的所有下标就全错位了。解法是给每个元素一个<strong>稳定的、稠密的、可比较的身份</strong>——无论别人怎么插入，你的元素身份不变，且任意两个身份之间总能再生成一个新身份（稠密序）。</p>\n<p>RGA（Replicated Growable Array）是经典方案：每个元素记录它&quot;插在谁之后&quot;，并用副本 ID + 计数器打破并发插入的平局。2026 年更前沿的是 Fugue 与基于 eg-walker 的方案，它们在抑制&quot;交织异常&quot;（两人并发输入的单词被字符级交错）和压缩元数据上更优。删除则统一用<strong>墓碑</strong>：被删元素不真删，只打标记，以便和并发编辑正确合并——这也是 <a href=\"../foundations/offline-conflict-challenges\">离线与冲突的本质挑战</a> 里提到的墓碑膨胀问题的根源。</p>\n<p>文本 CRDT 就是字符粒度的序列 CRDT。它能让两人在同一段落同时打字，结果字符交织共存而非互相覆盖——这是 Google Docs 级协作体验的数据基础。这套机制在生产中的封装，就是 <a href=\"../engines/yjs-collaborative\">Yjs</a> 这类库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-crdt-给真实应用建模\">用 CRDT 给真实应用建模</h2><p>理论之外，落地的关键是<strong>为每个字段挑对 CRDT 类型</strong>。以一个协作看板为例，下表演示如何把领域模型映射到 CRDT：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域字段</th>\n<th>选用 CRDT</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>卡片标题</td>\n<td>LWW-Register</td>\n<td>短文本，并发改同标题罕见，丢一个可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡片描述（富文本）</td>\n<td>文本序列 CRDT</td>\n<td>需字符级协作，不能整段覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡片标签集合</td>\n<td>OR-Set</td>\n<td>多人并发加不同标签应取并集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡片在列中的排序</td>\n<td>序列 CRDT（分数索引）</td>\n<td>拖拽重排需稳定位置身份</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>看板成员列表</td>\n<td>OR-Set</td>\n<td>加人删人并发需确定性收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点赞数</td>\n<td>PN-Counter</td>\n<td>并发点赞求和不丢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种&quot;逐字段选型&quot;的思路至关重要：把整张卡片当成一个 LWW 标量会让任何并发编辑互相覆盖，体验糟糕；而对每个字段细化到合适粒度，冲突面就被压到最小。粒度与元数据开销的权衡，前文 <a href=\"../foundations/offline-conflict-challenges\">离线与冲突的本质挑战</a> 已经讨论过。</p>\n<p>下图把建模流程串起来：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[拿到一个领域字段] --&gt; B{它是什么形态}&#10;  B --&gt;|单值| C[LWW-Register]&#10;  B --&gt;|累加量| D[PN-Counter]&#10;  B --&gt;|无序集合| E[OR-Set]&#10;  B --&gt;|有序列表| F[序列 CRDT]&#10;  B --&gt;|长文本| G[文本 CRDT]&#10;  C --&gt; H[组合成 CRDT-Map 表示整个对象]&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[拿到一个领域字段] --&gt; B{它是什么形态}\n  B --&gt;|单值| C[LWW-Register]\n  B --&gt;|累加量| D[PN-Counter]\n  B --&gt;|无序集合| E[OR-Set]\n  B --&gt;|有序列表| F[序列 CRDT]\n  B --&gt;|长文本| G[文本 CRDT]\n  C --&gt; H[组合成 CRDT-Map 表示整个对象]\n  D --&gt; H\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"crdt-的代价与边界\">CRDT 的代价与边界</h2><p>CRDT 不是免费的。每个 CRDT 都携带元数据——副本 ID、逻辑时间戳、墓碑——这些元数据可能比数据本身还大，尤其是经历过大量编辑和删除的文档。2026 年的主流库（Yjs、Loro）在编码压缩和墓碑回收上下了很大功夫，但元数据膨胀仍是真实约束。</p>\n<p>更重要的边界是：<strong>CRDT 保证收敛，不保证语义正确</strong>。它能让所有副本到达同一状态，但那个状态对业务是否合理是另一回事——库存能被并发扣成负数、删除可能&quot;赢&quot;掉了用户珍视的编辑。需要不变量（invariant）的强约束（唯一性、余额非负）超出了 CRDT 的能力，得靠服务端权威或额外协调。这条边界把 CRDT 的适用面圈定在&quot;能容忍最终一致&quot;的数据上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CRDT 的魔力源自合并满足结合律、交换律、幂等律，因此副本无需协调即单调收敛到同一状态。</li>\n<li>分状态型（CvRDT）与操作型（CmRDT）两流派，现代库多用 delta 状态型取两者之长。</li>\n<li>按数据形态选型：标量用 LWW、累加用 PN-Counter、集合用 OR-Set、序列/文本用带稳定身份的序列 CRDT。</li>\n<li>真实建模的关键是逐字段挑对类型并组合成 CRDT-Map，避免把整个对象当成粗粒度 LWW。</li>\n<li>代价是元数据/墓碑膨胀；边界是只保证收敛不保证业务语义，强不变量仍需服务端权威。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"ot-vs-crdt\">OT 与 CRDT 对比</a> —— CRDT 的历史竞争者及各自适用场景。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/yjs-and-automerge\">Yjs 与 Automerge</a> —— 实时协作视角下 CRDT 库的对照。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用层 CRDT","id":"应用层-crdt"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标量、计数、集合：从简到繁","id":"标量-计数-集合-从简到繁"},{"level":2,"text":"序列与文本：最难的 CRDT","id":"序列与文本-最难的-crdt"},{"level":2,"text":"用 CRDT 给真实应用建模","id":"用-crdt-给真实应用建模"},{"level":2,"text":"CRDT 的代价与边界","id":"crdt-的代价与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"同步引擎与传统请求模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/foundations/sync-engine-vs-rest"},"next":{"title":"OT 与 CRDT 对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/local-first-sync-engines/data-consistency/ot-vs-crdt"}}